1
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,980
=Weekend Crush=

2
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,580
(Tianjin, Mid-Autumn Festival)

3
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,780
(A car full of gifts)

4
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,580
(Checks his appearance)

5
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:02,980
(Clears throat)

6
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:04,000
Hello?

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,080
Hello!

8
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:05,880
Hi!

9
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:07,680
(Feels around)

10
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:08,280
Hello.

11
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,080
Hi.

12
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:09,880
Are you home?

13
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,480
Are you at...

14
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:10,960
Yeah.

15
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:13,020
(Kaiyi's parents' home)

16
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:14,820
(Kaiyi's POV, Kaiyi's dad)

17
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,320
(Kaiyi's mom)

18
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,520
What are we eating later?

19
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,560
Which restaurant?

20
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:21,120
We're going to a Tianjin restaurant.

21
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,200
Why'd you go quiet?

22
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:29,760
(Kaiyi's POV)

23
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,360
I went ahead and ordered a few dishes.

24
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,800
The ones we talked about.

25
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,760
Once you both get here,

26
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,640
we'll see what else you'd like.

27
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,280
(Thoughtfully asks)
We can order a few more then.

28
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,440
I ordered Eight Treasure tofu.

29
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,680
And fish.

30
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:44,240
(Kaiyi's POV)
Okay.

31
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:44,600
What else?

32
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,280
Sounds good.

33
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,040
I wasn't sure what you two liked,

34
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,840
so I ordered some of Kaiyi's favorites.

35
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,800
(Kaiyi's POV)

36
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:51,880
That's fine,

37
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:52,800
as long as Kaiyi likes it.

38
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:54,420
(Not bad)

39
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,480
Don't worry. We're easygoing.

40
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,440
We're not picky.

41
00:01:58,660 --> 00:01:59,920
(Chuckles)

42
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,840
We can order more later.

43
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:01,640
We'll add more then.

44
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,880
Okay.

45
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,320
You're actually nervous too.

46
00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:08,860
(Called out)

47
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,640
Alright, then...

48
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,280
(Kaiyi's POV)
Um, Yiheng...

49
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,800
Ready to have a drink with me later?

50
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,320
Sure.

51
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,080
(Answers instantly)
I'll drink with you.

52
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,680
Nice. That's the spirit.

53
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,840
I like your attitude, young man.

54
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,540
(Thumbs up)
You've earned a thumbs-up!

55
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:26,920
(Pleased)

56
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,920
You've earned a thumbs-up!

57
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,480
Alright, drive safe.

58
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,840
Take your time. No rush.

59
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,680
No rush.

60
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,120
Bye.

61
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,280
Yiheng's not bad.

62
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,520
What a good sport.

63
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,960
Didn't hesitate to have a drink.

64
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,600
You're the one who loves drinking.

65
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,120
How else are we gonna

66
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,000
bond without a drink,

67
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:54,840
right?

68
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,800
Mom, come sit here.

69
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,720
So you've watched the show.

70
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,760
You already know a bit about Yiheng.

71
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,040
He seems nice on the show.

72
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,280
(Mature)
Pretty mature, right?

73
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:06,840
Yeah.

74
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,800
He's the same in real life.

75
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,360
We're just worried Yiheng might

76
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,600
be even quieter

77
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,880
off camera.

78
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,760
(Kaiyi's POV)
Yiheng's funny too.

79
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,360
He has that dry sense of humor.

80
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,260
(Dry humor)

81
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,280
Let's go.

82
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,240
Alright, let me grab my stuff.

83
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:26,720
Let's go.

84
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:29,340
(Yiheng arrives at the restaurant early)

85
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:46,860
(Thinking)

86
00:03:52,180 --> 00:03:53,540
(Search: I'm having dinner
with my girlfriend)

87
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,540
(and her parents for the first time.
Where should everyone sit?)

88
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:56,780
(Taking it seriously)

89
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,060
I'll sit over here.

90
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,820
(Wipes the table,
rinses cups with hot water)

91
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:09,140
(Pours tea)

92
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:10,460
(Pours juice)

93
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:17,060
(What else?)

94
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:20,180
(Juice, tea)

95
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,140
(Fidgets)

96
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:30,300
(Napkins)

97
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:48,300
(Pacing)

98
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:54,180
(Nervous)

99
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:56,500
(Footsteps?)

100
00:05:04,380 --> 00:05:06,340
(Rubs hands together)

101
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:11,380
(Same hand-rubbing move)

102
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,620
I didn't sleep well last night.

103
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,360
Why not?

104
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,740
Couldn't fall asleep.

105
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:20,060
(Sleepless night)

106
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,600
Are you nervous today?

107
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,600
I can't sleep when I've
got something on my mind.

108
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:30,580
(Smiles)

109
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,840
I think Yiheng's pretty smart.

110
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:36,840
Really?

111
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,060
(Praises him)

112
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,360
Smarter than me?

113
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,440
You're equally smart.

114
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,640
I actually think Yiheng and I

115
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:51,760
have pretty similar personalities.

116
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,600
He's quiet around new people,

117
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,760
but opens up once he's comfortable.

118
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,660
(Two introverts)

119
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:01,280
I think character matters most,

120
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:01,760
right?

121
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:02,880
(Agrees)

122
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,320
Someone's true character

123
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,480
is the hardest thing to judge.

124
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,520
As the saying goes,

125
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,220
(Hear me out)
three years to judge jade,

126
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,800
seven years to judge a person.

127
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,680
You can't really know someone

128
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,520
in less than seven years.

129
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,720
At least seven years.

130
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,080
So basically,

131
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,320
good things take time.

132
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:31,380
(Adjusts the chairs)

133
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,700
(Respectful)

134
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:40,460
(Kaiyi's family arrives)

135
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:41,040
We're getting out.

136
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:45,180
(Grips tightly)

137
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,200
I'll get it.

138
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:03,120
Hello, sir.

139
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:07,640
Yiheng,

140
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,120
we finally meet.

141
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,040
You both look so young.

142
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,200
You're so slim.

143
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,280
That's scary.

144
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,360
Hello, ma'am.

145
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,200
(Bows)
Hello.

146
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:28,000
These are for your parents.

147
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,980
(Gifts prepared for Yiheng's parents)

148
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,000
Thank you.

149
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,320
I also brought

150
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,760
a few things for you both.

151
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,240
You shouldn't have.

152
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,920
These skincare products are for you.

153
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,520
I actually

154
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,480
asked Kaiyi which brand

155
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,200
would be best.

156
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:44,800
Thank you.

157
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,200
So I got these for you.

158
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:49,160
Thank you.

159
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,920
These two are health supplements

160
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,600
for you both.

161
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,480
And here's a foot spa.

162
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,920
It has a massage feature.

163
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,760
When you get home from work,

164
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,920
you can soak your feet.

165
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,640
It's really relaxing.

166
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,960
You're too kind.

167
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,720
Have a seat.

168
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,560
You bought too much.

169
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,000
Please, have a seat.

170
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:10,960
Alright.

171
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,880
Sit.

172
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,640
Sit wherever you like.

173
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:16,700
(Takes it)

174
00:08:17,180 --> 00:08:18,300
(Notices)

175
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,240
Have a seat.

176
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,200
Have a seat, Yiheng.

177
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:32,140
(Very cautiously)

178
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,800
Have you ordered?

179
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,440
I'll get the menu.

180
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,320
(Gets up)
I'll grab the list of what I ordered.

181
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:55,800
(Respectful)

182
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,560
I didn't order too much.

183
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,240
I wasn't sure

184
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,320
what you like to eat, sir.

185
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,040
Go get it, then.

186
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,160
Right, I'll grab it.

187
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,680
See if you'd like anything else.

188
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,680
Take a look, sir, ma'am.

189
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,520
What do you like to eat?

190
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,480
Kaiyi and I like

191
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:16,960
the same things.

192
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,560
You ordered them all.

193
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,000
Ordered them all.

194
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,400
How about this braised beef cartilage?

195
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:29,120
Do you eat beef, Yiheng?

196
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:31,850
Yeah.

197
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:35,480
How about some jellyfish with bok choy?

198
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,280
Sure.

199
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:37,760
Eight dishes. That's enough, right?

200
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,280
Yeah, that's two dishes each.

201
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,680
Two per person.

202
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:41,940
(Well-behaved)

203
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,920
(Pinches)
You look so sharp.

204
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,640
Even better than on TV!

205
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,720
You both look so young too.

206
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:52,980
(Grabs hold)

207
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:57,160
Still wanna be independent?

208
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,800
Not anymore.

209
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,640
(No more)
Not anymore.

210
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,120
That's what I like to hear.

211
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:09,600
My dad even said

212
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:11,360
he'd wear green today.

213
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,000
I was actually

214
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,160
thinking of asking

215
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,320
what you'd be wearing,

216
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,280
so we could match.

217
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,400
You do look different from TV.

218
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,800
More handsome, right?

219
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,480
You're definitely handsome.

220
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,040
Definitely.

221
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,000
(Compliments him)

222
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,680
Thank you, sir.

223
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,480
Thank you, ma'am.

224
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,600
You both look so young.

225
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,440
And so classy.

226
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,720
Young, really?

227
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,120
What a sweet talker.

228
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,480
You really do look young.

229
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,600
I was pretty nervous at first.

230
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,800
But when I saw you both

231
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,280
walk in with Kaiyi,

232
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:45,280
you seemed so warm.

233
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,400
I wasn't as nervous anymore.

234
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,360
I was nervous too.

235
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,440
Look at my dad.

236
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,200
He rubbed his chin red!

237
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,720
I barely slept last night.

238
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,880
Hardly slept a wink.

239
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,520
Kaiyi mentioned

240
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,240
that you're

241
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:25,120
(Starts a conversation)
a big soccer fan.

242
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:28,240
Yeah, I've only got three hobbies.

243
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,040
Watching soccer,

244
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:29,800
drinking,

245
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,200
and singing.

246
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,960
Singing? I love singing too.

247
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,840
We could

248
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,480
go sing together later.

249
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,360
Sure.

250
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,040
Sounds good.

251
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,400
You should sing...

252
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:43,920
You two should duet Red Bean.

253
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:44,660
(Requests a duet)

254
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,520
Right?

255
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:49,280
Sure.

256
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:51,560
Like that livestream you two did.

257
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,160
I even sent you guys...

258
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:53,920
Comments.

259
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,520
I posted in the chat.

260
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,600
You probably missed them.

261
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,240
Tell me which comment was yours.

262
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,680
I'll go back and watch it again.

263
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:03,040
Mine's 18920...

264
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:06,960
Stop giving out your phone number!

265
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:09,180
(Zipping lips)

266
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,120
Thank you.

267
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,480
Do you two eat rice?

268
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,440
Would you like some?

269
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,840
I can ask them to bring it now.

270
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,800
They'll probably bring it out soon.

271
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,680
Okay, I'll let them know.

272
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,000
Go ahead and eat.

273
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,800
(Fidgets)
You two go ahead first.

274
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,000
I'll do it.

275
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:35,960
I've got it.

276
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,220
(Offers to pour)
Pour me some.

277
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:37,800
I've got it.

278
00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:46,860
(Focused)

279
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,120
I'm not great at pouring drinks.

280
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:51,720
If I do

281
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,920
anything wrong, please teach me.

282
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,640
Come on, let's raise our glasses.

283
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:01,040
It's our first time meeting Yiheng,

284
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,120
and we're really happy.

285
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,120
Alright.

286
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,240
Make yourself at home.

287
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,040
Okay.

288
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:07,640
Eat and drink up.

289
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,320
Alright.

290
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,920
Cheers. Happy Mid-Autumn Festival.

291
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:13,280
Happy Mid-Autumn Festival!

292
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:15,470
Cheers.

293
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,580
Cheers.

294
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:18,900
