310
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,760
No, I think lighter's pretty good.

311
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:50,070
(Compliments him)
I liked that it was lighter.

312
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,920
I'll make it again sometime.

313
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:55,180
