Sure, make it again sometime.

314
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,760
Where'd you come from today?

315
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,160
I came from Wuqing.

316
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,000
From Wuqing?

317
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,800
Not just from outside, right?

318
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,200
You've figured me all out.

319
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,680
Tianjin-style food

320
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,040
(He knows all the lines)
with Northeast-sized portions, right?

321
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,520
Yeah.

322
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,960
That's one of your famous lines.

323
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,360
