324
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:24,640
He did.

325
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:25,920
(Heart Signal 9, EP 1 bonus footage)
Tianjin's most iconic dish

326
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:26,880
is Eight Treasure tofu.

327
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:27,800
Savory and sweet.

328
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:29,680
Yeah, we could make Tianjin dishes

329
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,200
with Northeast-sized portions.

330
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,720
Then everyone can dig in.

331
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,360
You watched more closely than I did.

332
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:40,000
I barely remember what I said.

333
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,120
How do you know all these inside jokes?

334
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:44,820
(Watched every single frame)

335
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,680
Here you go, sir.

336
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:49,380
Thank you.

337
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:51,340
(Serves him food)

338
00:14:58,460 --> 00:14:59,580
(Serves Mom some food)

339
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:03,620
(Notices)

340
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,360
