341
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,800
Let me pour you some.

342
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,100
(Gets up to pour tea)

343
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,880
Thank you.

344
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,560
Yiheng, you're so skinny.

345
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,720
