346
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:19,600
(Feels his arm)

347
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,400
So skinny.

348
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,200
Do you have some?

349
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:23,520
I do.

350
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:24,320
Want some?

351
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,080
Just a little.

352
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:25,880
I'll pour you some too.

353
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:29,220
(Glances)

354
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,010
Thank you.

355
00:15:33,980 --> 00:15:34,700
(Happy)

356
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:35,960
You're too skinny.

357
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,160
You need to eat more.

358
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,640
Eat more and work out more.

359
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,120
Right?

360
