364
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:53,800
you called Kaiyi

365
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,040
your second little sun,

366
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:55,480
right?

367
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:00,930
(She's the second little sun)
Can you explain that to me?

368
00:16:00,930 --> 00:16:01,880
(the world gave me.)
Can you explain that to me?

369
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:03,280
Why the second little sun?

370
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,600
Who's the first?

371
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,380
(Asking questions)

372
00:16:11,070 --> 00:16:12,480
The first one's up in the sky.

373
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,520
The first one's up in the sky.

374
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,360
The actual sun.

375
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:18,800
(Laughs)

376
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:19,680
The one in space.

377
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,480
In space.

378
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:21,980
(Nods)

379
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,040
So how's...

380
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,920
your mural work going?

381
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,100
Your mural business?

382
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:32,060
(Asks)

383
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:35,480
(Interested)
I'm still working on my previous orders.

384
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,520
Does anyone in your family,

385
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:40,880
maybe your elders,

386
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,800
work in art or anything?

387
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:43,800
No one in my family does.

388
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:44,480
No one?

389
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,240
Yeah.

390
00:16:46,660 --> 00:16:47,940
(Notices)

391
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,720
People always ask me

392
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,560
