393
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,040
My family's always been

394
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:56,080
really supportive of me.

395
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:56,600
They support me.

396
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,440
They support your passion.

397
00:16:58,520 --> 00:16:59,320
That's great.

398
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:07,640
