404
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,200
Partners.

405
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,880
Then, starting in March,

406
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:27,600
I started my own mural business.

407
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:28,800
It's still pretty new.

408
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,600
I want to give it my best.

409
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,320
I'll build it up slowly

410
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:35,880
