411
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:37,240
Keep improving along the way.

412
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:39,640
One step at a time, right?

413
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,400
Yeah, one step at a time.

414
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,320
I'll take it slow.

415
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,480
I only graduated a year ago.

416
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,780
Does Kaiyi have any flaws?

417
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:51,820
(Asks)

418
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,240
Flaws.

419
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,940
(Watching closely)

420
00:17:57,440 --> 00:17:58,200
I don't really...

421
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,640
I can't think of any.

422
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,320
Haven't noticed any.

423
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:01,720
