424
00:18:01,780 --> 00:18:02,740
(Flawless in his eyes)

425
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,800
She's got nothing but good qualities.

426
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:08,200
Every day, we're just...

427
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,280
We're always laughing together.

428
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,760
I haven't looked for flaws.

429
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,520
I don't focus on that stuff.

430
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:18,280
Do you think

431
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:19,680
Kaiyi looks like me?

432
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,840
Yeah. I noticed right away.

433
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,920
Kaiyi looks a bit

434
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:24,960
like both of you.

435
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:25,360
Yeah.

436
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,040
Yeah, both...

437
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,040
It's hard to explain.

438
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:28,880
But anyway,

439
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:30,360
