440
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:31,580
(So familiar)

441
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:35,840
Here.

442
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:37,720
Cheers.

443
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:39,320
Cheers.

444
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:49,130
I think Yiheng...

445
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:51,920
is really thoughtful.

446
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,200
And Kaiyi's more

447
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,560
carefree and easygoing.

448
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:58,120
Kaiyi's actually really thoughtful too.

449
00:18:58,560 --> 00:18:59,360
She is?

450
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,440
Yeah, it's just

451
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:05,160
people see her as carefree.

452
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:05,800
Yeah.

453
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:06,720
Yeah, she's really lively

454
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,920
and outgoing.

455
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:08,640
But

456
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:10,120
once you get to know her,

457
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:11,840
she's really thoughtful.

458
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,940
(Compliments her)

459
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:24,000
Yiheng's actually pretty talkative.

460
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,120
Not what I expected.

461
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:27,520
My mom thought you were mute.

462
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:28,800
No.

463
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:30,480
I didn't.

464
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:32,520
I thought you might be really shy

465
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:33,240
