476
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,520
because you're still a new couple

477
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:56,160
and he's trying to match your energy.

478
00:19:56,410 --> 00:19:58,320
But now I feel like he's

479
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,160
