482
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,560
Yesterday,

483
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,840
and even on my way here today,

484
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,720
I was really...

485
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,040
I was really worried

486
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,600
