487
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:17,920
Or that you two might be really strict.

488
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:20,400
Not at all.

489
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,080
Actually,

490
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:23,520
my dad planned to act all serious,

491
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,800
but he cracked the moment he walked in.

492
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:27,080
I'm pretty serious.

493
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,160
I'm serious.

494
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:29,540
(Serious)

495
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,040
Alright, let's

496
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:33,760
