499
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:38,640
and we stay safe and healthy.

500
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:39,640
Yeah.

501
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:41,240
And I hope Kaiyi

502
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,680
and Yiheng...

503
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:43,880
Stay happy.

504
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:44,920
Just keep being happy together.

505
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,000
Like that song Red Bean,

506
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,360
