507
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:49,680
(A love that lasts)

508
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,520
Thank you, sir.

509
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,600
Cheers.

510
00:20:56,260 --> 00:20:58,700
(Stands up)
Okay.

511
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:07,960
It's our first time meeting.

512
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,120
