514
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:10,600
Oh, no!

515
00:21:10,600 --> 00:21:11,200
Take it.

516
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,400
It's a gift from us.

517
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:14,120
(First-meeting gift)
We have to give you something.

518
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,280
It's tradition. Take it.

519
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:17,800
Just a little something. Take it.

520
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,080
A Mid-Autumn Festival red envelope.

521
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,800
Thank you, ma'am.

522
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:21,800
You're welcome.

523
00:21:23,420 --> 00:21:26,420
(Smiles)

524
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,360
Shall we get going?

525
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:35,440
Let's go.

526
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:36,920
Time for karaoke.

527
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:37,520
Karaoke.

528
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:38,680
I'll call a designated driver.

529
00:21:41,120 --> 00:21:42,240
How should we sit?

530
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:43,800
You two can sit in the back.

531
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:44,800
I'll sit up front.

532
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:45,720
I'm closing the door.

533
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:46,360
Okay.

534
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:46,880
Go ahead.

535
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:48,580
(Carefully closes the car door)

536
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:51,800
Let's go.

537
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,560
Let's go.

538
00:21:57,280 --> 00:21:58,520
So how long

539
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:00,040
are we planning to sing?

540
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:02,920
Until...

541
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:03,880
Until we're tired.

542
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,200
As long as we want.

543
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,040
Until we're tired!

544
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:07,060
(Just what I wanted)

545
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:08,680
Sounds good.

546
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:17,160
Thank you, ma'am.

547
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:17,560
Sure.

548
00:22:17,560 --> 00:22:18,360
No problem.

549
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,960
Have a seat.

550
00:22:23,460 --> 00:22:24,400
You guys pick some songs.

551
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:25,860
(Leaves the room)
I need to use the restroom.

552
00:22:30,380 --> 00:22:31,060
(Glances)

553
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,680
You pick a song.

554
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:34,960
Let Yiheng pick.

555
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,120
Okay, I'll pick.

556
00:22:47,460 --> 00:22:50,340
(Stares)

557
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:52,600
Let's pick some songs together.

558
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:53,480
What do you wanna sing?

559
00:22:54,460 --> 00:22:55,740
(Leans in to look)

560
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,960
Who do you two usually listen to?

561
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:00,840
Let's pick something

562
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:02,320
