569
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,280
You mean Invisible Wings.

570
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,040
Oh, right.

571
00:23:13,040 --> 00:23:14,000
Invisible Wings.

572
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:15,000
Can you sing it?

573
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:17,600
I'll just wing it.

574
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,280
I remember hearing it

575
00:23:19,280 --> 00:23:21,080
