577
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:32,640
♪Every time♪

578
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:36,040
♪I find strength in loneliness♪

579
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,420
That's not the song, is it?

580
00:23:37,420 --> 00:23:38,220
(Doubtful)

581
00:23:39,680 --> 00:23:40,160
It's not?

582
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:40,960
Nope.

583
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,600
